WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.750
One of the mantras we have heard
ad nauseum since the beginning

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.140
of the COVID situation has been
that we need to follow the

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:12.030
science. This phrase is repeated
over and over by politicians, by

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.510
experts and by celebrities.
"Let's end the politics and

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:19.740
follow the science." This phrase
must be expressed with a certain

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.520
level of condescension, implying
strongly that your ideological

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.970
or political enemy is not
following the science. And if

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:30.300
they did follow the science,
then they would naturally agree

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.740
with your political position.
"Will people listen to

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:42.780
scientists?" We've heard certain
political parties smugly even

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.440
call themselves the "party of
science". Now, we could argue

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.260
all day long over who is
actually following the science

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.170
and people do, pointing fingers
at each other, and going down

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:56.190
the dreadful line of clickbait
headlines citing some new study

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:59.610
which suggests how their
position is the one following

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:03.780
the science. But to do that is
already to miss the forest for

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:07.710
the trees, because it is
actually simply, and dare I say

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:12.060
technically, impossible to
simply follow the science.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:41.130
The question is far more
important than just surrounding

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:44.340
the current COVID situation.
It's rather the sign of the

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:47.970
general blind materialism which
rules the common discourse.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.800
We're wowed by the scientific
priestly caste. We only need to

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.710
look at the type of reverence
the media placed around Dr.

00:01:55.710 --> 00:02:00.660
Fauci in the United States. But
like I said, despite our

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:05.670
officials constantly repeating
this mantra, it is impossible to

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:08.790
just follow science, at least
not at the outset.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:12.815
When science is doing what it's
supposed to, it's an accurate

00:02:12.882 --> 00:02:17.122
and quantifiable description of
phenomena at a certain level of

00:02:17.189 --> 00:02:20.217
reality. And so because
phenomena happen in a

00:02:20.285 --> 00:02:24.322
predictable pattern, then once
you've described a phenomenon

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:28.226
accurately enough, it can be
possible to produce the same

00:02:28.293 --> 00:02:31.658
phenomena with similar
conditions. So think of the

00:02:31.725 --> 00:02:35.830
scientific process as producing
something like a recipe book.

00:02:35.898 --> 00:02:40.003
Once you've identified something
relevant, let's say making a

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:44.175
pound cake, then the recipe book
will tell you what stuff the

00:02:44.242 --> 00:02:47.809
cake is made of. So if you
follow a set process using

00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:51.712
similar quantities, you know,
what certain raw materials,

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:56.019
eggs, flour, etc, and a certain
amount of time, then you should

00:02:56.087 --> 00:02:59.788
be able to reliably produce the
phenomena which will be

00:02:59.855 --> 00:03:04.095
recognised, which will have the
recognised qualities of a pound

00:03:04.162 --> 00:03:08.200
cake. So notice I said if you
follow a set process, which of

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:12.440
course seems to suggest that you
can, in fact, follow science,

00:03:12.507 --> 00:03:16.612
but this is exactly where lies
the problem and the blind spot

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:20.987
which has become so common. You
can only follow the science once

00:03:21.054 --> 00:03:25.159
you have identified what it is
you care about, what it is you

00:03:25.226 --> 00:03:29.466
want to do, and especially what
is your hierarchy of priorities

00:03:29.533 --> 00:03:34.110
within a certain context.
Science cannot tell you what is important.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.450
So let's say you decide you want
to kill as many people as

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:41.500
efficiently as possible, well,
then you can follow the science

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:45.160
to find the best procedure and
tools to do so. If you want to

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:48.340
reproduce a nuclear explosion,
make people addicted to your

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:52.210
product, create an army of
robots, then science can

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.900
possibly help provide a map to
accomplish these measurable

00:03:55.900 --> 00:04:00.490
goals. But science has no tools
whatsoever for telling you what

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:04.030
you should do, what goals you
should be aiming for. And

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:08.020
science also cannot tell you
what is the reasonable amount of

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:12.130
resources you should spend on a
certain goal, or what else you

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:15.430
need to sacrifice to accomplish
your goal. So let's say you want

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:18.910
to make your pound cake. But you
can only get eggs by driving two

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:22.030
hours from your house. Well,
science has no way of telling

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:25.540
you if that is a reasonable
thing to do. Or if you want that

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.780
pound cake enough to sacrifice
that time and energy to still

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:32.800
make it, maybe you do. And this
blindness has been the source of

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:36.370
one of the biggest political
clashes since the end of World

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.000
War Two.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:42.700
Following the science has
provided the means of material

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:47.410
excess of comfort and throwaway
culture and now other branches

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:51.730
of science, environmental
science, is telling us to follow

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:55.570
the science to save the
environment from the results of

00:04:55.570 --> 00:05:01.180
this other branch of science who
develop their industrial thrust

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:04.810
by following the science. And so
science is a tool and neither of

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:07.900
these opposing narratives,
neither the reason for the

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:11.620
development of industrial
civilization, or the reason for

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.940
the green reduction of energy
consumptions are scientific in

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:22.420
themselves. Both paths, both
mentalities, follow the science,

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:28.030
but they do so to their desired
goal. So this whole question has

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:31.690
reached almost absurd levels
with the COVID situation. We're

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:35.590
constantly told to follow the
science, that, you know, this or

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:40.330
that political decision or
mandate is not in fact political

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:45.010
but is mandated by science. At
best, this is the naive

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:48.460
proposition of people who are
unaware of their own frame,

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:53.230
unaware of what motivates their
action, but at worst, it is a

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:56.590
new form of moralising which
wants to pretend that its moral

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:00.610
stances are as self-evident and
as provable as two plus two

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:04.630
equals four. The goal is
sometimes stated. At first, we

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.560
had a goal, we were told that we
needed to prevent the medical

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.980
system from being overwhelmed.
But then the goalpost moved

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:15.580
invisibly to, "We need to stop
our people from dying at all

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:19.540
costs." And finally, the
goalpost became, "We need to

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:23.020
stop this disease from being
spread to anybody at all."

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:26.930
So despite moving the goalposts,
authorities continued to use

00:06:26.994 --> 00:06:30.978
this same message, "Follow the
science," while pretending that

00:06:31.043 --> 00:06:35.220
the goal is continually obvious.
It is just taken for granted and

00:06:35.284 --> 00:06:39.012
is just plainly there in the
science itself. Of course, if

00:06:39.076 --> 00:06:42.610
you have followed my channel,
you have bumped into this

00:06:42.675 --> 00:06:46.274
problem over and over. It's the
problem that I had in my

00:06:46.338 --> 00:06:50.515
discussion with Brett Weinstein,
where science was posited at the

00:06:50.579 --> 00:06:54.307
top of the hierarchy of meaning.
It's the blind spot in my

00:06:54.371 --> 00:06:57.970
discussion with Rationality
Rules, where moral arguments

00:06:58.034 --> 00:07:01.762
were made as if their ultimate
purpose were evident, while

00:07:01.826 --> 00:07:05.682
simultaneously being incapable
of framing, of naming or even

00:07:05.746 --> 00:07:09.538
seeing that purpose before
invoking this or that example or

00:07:09.602 --> 00:07:13.522
this or that consequence. All of
these conversations are in a

00:07:13.586 --> 00:07:17.314
different way than we usually
mean it. They are blinded by

00:07:17.378 --> 00:07:21.555
science, honestly thinking their
objective, though blind to their

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.640
presuppositions. Thinking
they're objective and

00:07:24.704 --> 00:07:28.432
scientific, they take their
unseen presuppositions as self

00:07:28.496 --> 00:07:32.416
evident truths, which people,
which all good people or people

00:07:32.481 --> 00:07:36.529
who have good intention, should
be able to see. And so those of

00:07:36.594 --> 00:07:39.935
us who question this or that
moral position can find

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.534
ourselves in dangerous
situations. Because if one takes

00:07:43.599 --> 00:07:46.940
their point of view as
self-evident, this inevitably

00:07:47.005 --> 00:07:50.861
means that those who do not
share this perspective are doing

00:07:50.925 --> 00:07:54.395
so out of ill will, or with
purposeful and utilitarian

00:07:54.459 --> 00:07:58.572
denial of science. That's why we
always hear a note of contempt.

00:07:58.637 --> 00:08:02.750
Every time a political figure or
public figure says, "Follow the

00:08:02.814 --> 00:08:06.670
science" or when they suggest
that their political opponents

00:08:06.734 --> 00:08:10.140
refuse to follow the science.
Accusing someone of not

00:08:10.204 --> 00:08:13.803
following science is akin to
accusing them of breaking a

00:08:13.868 --> 00:08:16.888
divine command. Science is of
course objective,

00:08:16.952 --> 00:08:20.937
non-ideological, and so to not
follow science is to go against

00:08:21.001 --> 00:08:24.857
reality itself. It's a sin,
properly speaking, for those who

00:08:24.921 --> 00:08:25.950
think like this.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:29.440
Of course, all the while the
inquisitor is hiding or maybe

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:34.060
even unaware of the true purpose
of his actions. That is why I

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:40.150
say there is imminent danger
right now. As for the reality of

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:43.960
safety versus danger, of saving
lives versus providing

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:48.250
opportunity, normal societies
have always had to find ways to

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:53.230
balance these extremes. It's not
easy, of course. But this is an

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.620
inevitable discussion that we
should be able to have without

00:08:56.620 --> 00:09:00.130
those who want to have the
discussion being accused of

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:04.210
being "science deniers" or being
insensitive and evil. If the

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.840
goal of human society was only
to save lives, we would not go

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:12.760
rafting or mountain climbing or
even get on the highway. We know

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.820
that intuitively. But despite
that, we're suddenly paralysed

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:19.480
by this strange illusion that
safety and protecting our bodies

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:23.950
is the only value that matters.
Of course, it would be absurd to

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:27.580
say that it does not matter. Of
course it matters, we should

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.850
care for the physical wellness
of those around us. But it

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:35.140
cannot be our only guiding
value. Safety cannot be

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:38.680
accomplished at the expense of
every other value which

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:43.330
constitute the human experience.
Value like community exchange,

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:48.760
adventure, risk taking and
especially worship. Every time

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:53.050
you get into a car, you risk
your life. And every moment you

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:57.880
are in a car you could die in a
few seconds. And this is in no

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.850
way under your control. You're
are also at the mercy of other

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:05.410
drivers. In the United States,
for example, the rate of death

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:10.450
for car is about 12.4 per
10,000. But there are also 4

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:15.130
million people who are seriously
injured by car crashes. Road

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:18.580
crashes are in fact the leading
cause of death in people between

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:23.980
1 and 54 years old. Now, we
could reduce the death and

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:28.780
injury rate of car crashes very
easily. We could simply stop all

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:33.070
private cars from going on the
road. Done. Or we could reduce

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:37.690
the speed on the highway at 20
miles per hour. I mean, I bet

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:41.740
that would bring down the car
death toll and injury took

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:46.600
nearly zero. It would work but
we're not going to do it. So why

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:52.240
aren't we going to do it? I
mean, why wouldn't we do it? Am

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:56.050
I saying that getting to my hair
appointment or to some, you

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:59.350
know, to go to the mall is more
important than people dying?

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:05.330
So we intuitively understand
that in order to live our lives

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:09.200
we incur risks of dying. Of
course, car crashes and

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:12.350
infectious diseases are not the
same. And we certainly need to

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:15.290
care for the weak and the
elderly. But my point is rather

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:18.230
to feature our willingness to
accept the constant risk of

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:22.970
dying at any second every day.
And intuitively knowing that

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:27.020
safety cannot become the only
value which drives our society.

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:31.910
And we must be very wary of
those who refuse to even have

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:35.540
the discussion, insisting that
the very discussion is immoral,

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:39.650
because it doesn't "follow the
science." We have to be more

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:44.540
aware of what a human being is,
and not let that go to the side

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:49.460
in a society that is built only
on one single value, a value of

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:54.770
safety or security. A human
person is more complex has other

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:59.270
values, other purposes and some
are actually more important than

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:00.050
our safety.

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:04.964
I hope enjoyed this discussion
on Symbolic World. As you might

00:12:05.023 --> 00:12:08.229
have noticed, I am in a new
space. I am back in my home

00:12:08.288 --> 00:12:11.902
since the flood in 2019. But you
can also notice that I am not

00:12:11.961 --> 00:12:15.109
yet set up. I'm really
struggling to set up my office;

00:12:15.167 --> 00:12:18.841
the stores are all closed, we're
on lockdown and the stores are

00:12:18.899 --> 00:12:22.572
also out of everything. I can't
even find a desk the right size

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:26.362
for the office. And so I'm kind
of floating around trying to get

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:29.918
everything installed and trying
to get everything right. But

00:12:29.976 --> 00:12:33.358
very soon, things will be
better, you notice the camera is

00:12:33.416 --> 00:12:36.856
better, the sound will also be
better, the lighting will be

00:12:36.915 --> 00:12:40.180
better. And so I'm really
excited to see what 2020 one's

00:12:40.238 --> 00:12:43.794
going to offer us in terms of
insanity. And hopefully I'll be

00:12:43.853 --> 00:12:47.293
able to comment on it as best I
can. And so I want to thank

00:12:47.351 --> 00:12:50.907
everybody for your support. As
you know, everything I'm doing

00:12:50.966 --> 00:12:54.580
here is thanks to your support.
And so if you're interested in

00:12:54.639 --> 00:12:57.146
supporting the podcast, these
videos, go to

00:12:57.204 --> 00:13:00.819
thesymbolicworld.com/support,
you will find ways to support it

00:13:00.877 --> 00:13:04.434
there. You can also buy some of
my designs, different designs

00:13:04.492 --> 00:13:08.049
that I've made on Teespring. And
so thanks everybody and I'll

00:13:08.107 --> 00:13:09.390
talk to you very soon.

